wrote sweep_demos.json

pair_est is (dev_rate * user_rate)^4 -- the fraction of pairs expected to
survive QC. You need roughly 50/70 = 71%, so aim for both per-line rates
above ~93%. If the user column plateaus well below that, more demos are not
the answer and the plateau is the result to report.
